   <message name="IDS_PRIVACY_SANDBOX_M1_CONSENT_LEARN_MORE_EXPAND_LABEL" desc="This is an actionable string, allowing the user to learn more about the Ad topics setting. The name of the setting is 'Ad topics', with a capital 'A'. So here in this string, we use 'ad topics' to help the user find the setting later in Settings, but we're more referring to the concept of topics of interest than the setting. Both are important.">
